What is an API?

Application programming interface,that helps to communicate 2 or more ends (technologies, servers, hardware devices etc...) despite of uses different technologies.

Types of API's

1. Open API's (Public APIs)
	1. Available for any one to use with or with out registeration.
		Exmaple : Map, GitHub Api
		Used foe there data and services

2. Internal API's (Private APIs)
   1. Used only inside the company/orgnization
      Exmaple : HR system API to fetch employee Data
      Secure, not exposed data to outside world

3. Partner APIs
	    1. Shared data with selected business partner.
	    Example: flight booking, Train ticket booking
	    Controlled access.

4. Composite APIs
		Combine multiple API to make one call
		Example: One API that checks order info + payment info + shipping details


Categories of APIs
	
	1. Web APIs - Amazon, Whatsapp, Facebook
	2. Library API - JDK, Selenium Jar, Rest-assured
	3. Operating System API - calcutor, powerpoint MSoffice
	4. HardWare API - USB, Microphone, headSet, earpod


